# Trim the Docker build context (the repo root) for the lean apps/api image
# (apps/api/Dockerfile). The Dockerfile COPYs only the api closure; this keeps the
# heavy + irrelevant stuff out of the context sent to the daemon — above all the
# mobile React-Native tree and every node_modules.

**/node_modules
.git

# never ship the dotenvx PRIVATE key, and only .env.production is needed
.env.keys
.env.development
.env.example

# not part of the api closure
apps/mobile
packages/sim
packages/generator
packages/drive-core

# dev/test/build cruft
**/.expo
**/.scratch
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.md
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.github
